$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A Porphyrin-Inspired Iron Catalyst for Asymmetric Epoxidation of
Electron-Deficient Olefins
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
