$DATUM stereoselective
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Efficient Control of the Diastereoselectivity and Regioselectivity in the
Singlet-Oxygen Ene Reaction of Chiral Oxazolidine-Substituted Alkenes by
a Remote Urea NH Functionality: Comparison with Dimethyldioxirane and
m-Chloroperbenzoic Acid Epoxidations
